<view class="page safe-bottom"><view class="title">日历</view><view class="subtitle">每一餐，都是生活的一小段回忆。</view><view wx:if="{{!days.length}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-icon">✦</view><view>还没有记录</view><view class="empty-sub">回到“今天”，从第一餐开始吧。</view></view><view wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="dateKey" class="day-card"><view class="day-title">{{item.label}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.slots}}" wx:key="key" wx:for-item="slot" class="history-row" bindtap="openDetail" data-id="{{slot.record.id}}"><image wx:if="{{slot.record}}" class="thumb" src="{{slot.record.stylizedImage || slot.record.imagePath}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view wx:else class="thumb placeholder">＋</view><view class="history-label">{{slot.emoji}} {{slot.label}}</view><view class="muted">{{slot.record ? '已记录' : '未记录'}}</view></view></view></view>
